---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Grower Resources" description="Resources, information, and support for Wisconsin cranberry growers from the Wisconsin Cranberry Board.">
  
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-cranberry-950 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/stock/cranberry-bog-1.jpg"
        alt="Wisconsin cranberry harvest operations"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-cranberry-950/90 to-cranberry-950/60"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 lg:py-28">
      <p class="text-cranberry-300 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">For Our Growers</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-white font-heading mb-6 max-w-3xl leading-tight">
        Grower Resources
      </h1>
      <p class="text-cranberry-100 text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        The Wisconsin Cranberry Board provides resources and information to help Wisconsin cranberry growers make informed decisions, adopt best practices, and thrive in the industry.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="bg-warm-100 border-b border-warm-200" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-3">
      <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-earth-500">
        <li><a href="/" class="hover:text-cranberry-700 transition-colors">Home</a></li>
        <li><svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M7.21 14.77a.75.75 0 01.02-1.06L11.168 10 7.23 6.29a.75.75 0 111.04-1.08l4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 010 1.08l-4.5 4.25a.75.75 0 01-1.06-.02z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path></svg></li>
        <li class="text-cranberry-800 font-medium">Grower Resources</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Assessment Information -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-warm-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-cranberry-950 font-heading mb-6">Grower Assessment</h2>
          <p class="text-earth-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            The Wisconsin Cranberry Board is funded through a grower assessment on each barrel of cranberries produced in Wisconsin. These funds are reinvested directly into programs that benefit the entire cranberry industry.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-warm-200 shadow-sm mb-8">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-4">2025 Assessment Rate</h3>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-4">
              <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-cranberry-700 font-heading">25¢</div>
              <div class="text-earth-600">per barrel of cranberries produced</div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              The Board unanimously voted to increase the assessment rate from 10¢ to 25¢ per barrel for the 2025 growing season. This increase bolsters support for current projects and ensures resources are available to address future industry challenges.
            </p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-earth-600 leading-relaxed">
            More than 300 licensed cranberry producers across Wisconsin contribute to the assessment, which generates approximately $550,000+ annually in funding for research, education, and promotion programs.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-6">
          <!-- Where Your Assessment Goes -->
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-warm-200 shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-6">Where Your Assessment Goes</h3>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                  <span class="text-earth-700 font-medium">Research Projects</span>
                  <span class="text-cranberry-700 font-bold">~40%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-warm-100 rounded-full h-3">
                  <div class="bg-cranberry-600 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 40%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                  <span class="text-earth-700 font-medium">Education & Promotion</span>
                  <span class="text-cranberry-700 font-bold">~45%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-warm-100 rounded-full h-3">
                  <div class="bg-forest-600 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 45%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-2">
                  <span class="text-earth-700 font-medium">Administration</span>
                  <span class="text-cranberry-700 font-bold">~15%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="w-full bg-warm-100 rounded-full h-3">
                  <div class="bg-earth-500 h-3 rounded-full" style="width: 15%"></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="text-earth-500 text-xs mt-4">
              <!-- [PLACEHOLDER: Exact percentages to be confirmed with Board] -->
              Approximate allocation — actual percentages vary by year based on Board priorities.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Board Elections -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-white border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-cranberry-950 font-heading mb-6">Board Elections & Participation</h2>
        <p class="text-earth-700 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          The Wisconsin Cranberry Board is composed of seven grower-members, each serving a three-year term. Elections are administered by DATCP, with nominations typically opening each April.
        </p>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-12">
          <div class="bg-warm-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-warm-200">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-4">How to Run for the Board</h3>
            <ol class="space-y-3 text-earth-700 text-sm">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="bg-cranberry-700 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">1</span>
                <span>Nominations open each April through DATCP</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="bg-cranberry-700 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">2</span>
                <span>Must be a licensed Wisconsin cranberry producer</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="bg-cranberry-700 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">3</span>
                <span>Submit nomination forms by the posted deadline</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="bg-cranberry-700 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">4</span>
                <span>Ballots are mailed to all licensed producers</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                <span class="bg-cranberry-700 text-white w-6 h-6 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 text-xs font-bold">5</span>
                <span>New terms begin September 1</span>
              </li>
            </ol>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-warm-50 rounded-2xl p-8 border border-warm-200">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-4">Board Meetings</h3>
            <p class="text-earth-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              The Wisconsin Cranberry Board meets regularly throughout the year to review proposals, approve funding, and set strategic direction for the industry.
            </p>
            <p class="text-earth-700 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
              Meetings are open to the public. For meeting schedules and agendas, contact the Board office.
            </p>
            <div class="bg-cranberry-50 rounded-xl p-4">
              <p class="text-cranberry-800 text-sm font-medium">Questions about elections?</p>
              <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm">DATCP Market Orders Program<br />(608) 224-5046</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Resources & Links -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-28 bg-warm-50 border-t border-warm-200">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-cranberry-950 font-heading mb-4">Industry Resources</h2>
        <p class="text-earth-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Helpful links and resources for Wisconsin cranberry growers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <a href="https://www.wiscran.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-200 hover:border-cranberry-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-2 group-hover:text-cranberry-700">WI Cranberry Growers Association</h3>
          <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The WSCGA provides educational resources, industry advocacy, and networking opportunities for Wisconsin cranberry growers.</p>
          <span class="text-cranberry-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Visit wiscran.org
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://www.wisconsincranberryresearchstation.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-200 hover:border-cranberry-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-2 group-hover:text-cranberry-700">WI Cranberry Research Station</h3>
          <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">The research station near Black River Falls hosts cutting-edge research projects to advance cranberry production and sustainability.</p>
          <span class="text-cranberry-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Learn More
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://fruit.wisc.edu/cranberries/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-200 hover:border-cranberry-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-2 group-hover:text-cranberry-700">UW-Madison Cranberry Resources</h3>
          <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Research-based information on cranberry cultivation, pest management, and sustainability from UW-Madison Extension.</p>
          <span class="text-cranberry-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Visit UW Resources
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://ipcm.wisc.edu" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-200 hover:border-cranberry-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-2 group-hover:text-cranberry-700">Integrated Pest & Crop Management</h3>
          <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">UW-Madison's program brings research-based pest management and nutrient management information to Wisconsin farmers.</p>
          <span class="text-cranberry-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Visit IPCM
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://datcp.wi.gov/Pages/AgDevelopment/WisconsinCranberryBoard.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-200 hover:border-cranberry-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-2 group-hover:text-cranberry-700">DATCP — Cranberry Board Page</h3>
          <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Official DATCP page for the Wisconsin Cranberry Board, including election information and regulatory details.</p>
          <span class="text-cranberry-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            Visit DATCP
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>

        <a href="https://admin.cals.wisc.edu/offices/research-division/commodity-board-funding-opportunities/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border border-warm-200 hover:border-cranberry-300 hover:shadow-lg transition-all group">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-cranberry-900 font-heading mb-2 group-hover:text-cranberry-700">Research Funding Opportunities</h3>
          <p class="text-earth-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">Information from UW-Madison CALS about the WCB's annual calls for proposals for research and education projects.</p>
          <span class="text-cranberry-700 text-sm font-medium inline-flex items-center gap-1">
            View Opportunities
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"></path></svg>
          </span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
